# Toyota Aygo five-door hatchback, 2005-2014.
#
# The Toyota version of the Toyota/Peugeot/Citroën city-car trio, built in the
# Czech Republic: 3,415 mm long, 1,615 mm wide, 1,465 mm high, 2,340 mm
# wheelbase; 1.0 three-cylinder petrol. Facelift in 2009.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toyota_Aygo
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Grey are documented Toyota colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 40 in total (white 14, red 10, blue 9, grey 7).
#
# Speed 155 km/h; comfort 75/295 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 2005-2014 with a road tail to about 2024.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/toyota-aygo.blend. References:
# citycars/references/toyota-aygo/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

